# Implementation Plan - Phase 1: Core Marketplace (Auth & Dashboard)

# Goal Description
Execute the "Core Marketplace" functionality. This includes strict Authentication with RBAC (Admin, Merchant, Consumer), Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) for privileged roles, and the initial Merchant Onboarding and Dashboard screens.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Authentication Provider**:
> We will use **Firebase Auth** (or Supabase Auth) as per Tech Stack.
> - **Consumers**: Email/Password, Google Sign-in.
> - **Merchants**: Email/Password + **Mandatory MFA** (TOTP/SMS).
> - **Admins**: **Mandatory MFA + IP Whitelisting** (if possible in free tier).

> [!WARNING]
> **Stripe Connect**:
> The "Connect" flow requires a real redirect URL. We will use `localhost:3000` for dev, but we need to provision the Stripe Test Mode keys soon.

